1
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:06,000
A Monsterrific Musical!

2
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:06,000
Monster High: Boo York, Boo York is a animation,
family, music film directed by William Lau.

3
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
It's fright lights, big city when the Monster High ghouls head to Boo York!

4
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:06,000
Cleo de Nile is invited to attend a gancy gala celebrating the return of the
magical comet and, of course, she brings along her beast friends.

5
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
But their trip isn't all fun and frightseeing because Nefera, Cleo's sister,
uses the comet's power for her own spooktacularly sneaky plans.

6
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
Can the monsters unwrap the mystery of the comet in time to stop Nefera?

7
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:06,000
Find out in Booy York, Boo York, the first-ever Monster
High musical, featuring eight original songs.

8
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:06,000
Cleo de Nile / Clawdeen Wolf (voice), played by Salli Saffioti.

9
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:06,000
Catty Noir (voice), played by Missi Hale.

10
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Pharaoh / Seth Ptolemy (voice), played by TJ Smith.

11
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Deuce Gorgon / Agent (voice), played by Evan Smith.

12
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:06,000
Nefera de Nile (voice), played by Wendee Lee.

13
00:52:00,000 --> 00:52:06,000
Frankie Stein (voice), played by Kate Higgins.

14
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
Monster High: Boo York, Boo York is a 2015 CGI-animated musical adventure fantasy children's film released on
home video on September 29 and broadcast on Nickelodeon as a television special on October 25.

15
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Directed by William Lau and written by Keith Wagner, who also provided its story and screenplay, the film is the 9th in the
list of CGI-animated films and the 12 animated film overall based on the Monster High doll franchise by Mattel.

16
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:06,000
The soundtrack charted on Billboard's US Kid Albums and US Soundtracks.

17
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
The tone is lighthearted.
